+class NuComplete(ShellComplete):
+    """Shell completion for Nushell, as an external completer.
+
+    The script defines a command that the external completer of the
+    user's ``config.nu`` calls with the words of the command line. The
+    answer is a JSON list of records with a ``value`` and, for items with
+    a help text, a ``description``. When an item asks for file or
+    directory completion the answer is ``null``, so that Nushell
+    completes paths itself.
